## Usage Example

**Apply CRD:**
- kubectl apply -f docs/services/node-connect/service-crd-template.yaml.tmpl
   This is a template file; actual deployment may use helm chart values.

If using `kubectl`: create this as resource spec and let operator handle lifecycle. If no controller exists yet, fall back to manual Node Registry API calls (e.g., Gateway `/nodes/pair` endpoint) or the node-connect skill for setup/repair flows.



